  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 506.05 Other Transactions of Earth. Earth that is given away, bartered or exchanged shall not be exempt from the excavation tax for the tax year in which it was excavated.\n\nSource. #7381, eff 10-24-00; ss by #7860, eff 3-31-03 EXPIRED: 3-31-11\n\nNew. #9926, eff 5-18-11 (from Rev 507.04); ss by #12834, eff 7-25-19",
